  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">학교에 닭의장풀 뜯어서 현미경으로 관찰하는데 공변세포 주변의 표피세포를 확대해서 잘보면 공변세포보다 매우 작으면서 얇고긴 직사각형이 매우 많이 있는데 저건 무엇일가요...? 움직이지는 않는것 같은데..미생물인가요...? 수업하다가 혹여나 질문하면 어쩌나해서 여쭤봅니다...!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97636a4c960fe42cc07f63be7cb60fccb3c7a7eb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/97636a4c960fe42cc07f63be7cb60fccb3c7a7eb\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"1038\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3960eab547a2eb31e52f55d90d668dcbc43d6bde\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3960eab547a2eb31e52f55d90d668dcbc43d6bde\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
